    "description": "Acted in various roles as a technology consultant, including teaching, developing, designing, and technical support.\n●\tProvided ongoing support for IONA's B2B server product. Tasks include new feature design, development, bug diagnosis, bug fixes and security enhancement.\n●\tDeveloped and taught Web Service Training Course using .NET and Apache Axis. The course taught basic web service concepts such as SOAP, WSDL, JAX-RPC, JAXP, JAXR, and SAAJ. Its course exercises covered web service invocation, web service creation, complex type mapping, and UDDL. The .NET part is developed in C#. The J2EE part is developed with Axis on JBOSS.\n●\tOn site technical developer for clients such as Intel, the Dept of Homeland Security, Boeing, NTT etc.\n",
