    "description": "●\tWorked for a large insurance company to develop its first online enrollment program. The project revolutionized the company's insurance enrollment process by enabling end-user enrollments through call center, web and traditional paper channels. The system was a web based three-tier Java application that provided autonomous transaction processing, legacy database access, complex business logic and great flexibility. We used Sybase Transaction Server and servlet architecture as our initial choice while the J2EE specification was being improved upon. Began initial prototyping of the system transition to WebSphere and WebLogic using EJB. The Specific technical skills used in this project were Java, XML, XSL, JavaScript, and SQL, UML Modeling, Visual Basic.",
